[
    {
        "content": "<p>Lean's extensible syntax is powerful.  However, any keyword that I use in any syntax category can no longer be an identifier anywhere.  For example, suppose that I declare a syntax category <code>color</code> and use it in a macro:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"red\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"blue\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"green\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"color\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">red</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">blue</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">green</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Macro</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">throwError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"unknown\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Now this definition will fail:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">red</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">blue</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">red</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">blue</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>It produces</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">unexpected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">token</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">'</span><span class=\"n\">red'</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">'_'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">identifier</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>In this example really I'd like \"red\", \"blue\" and \"green\" to be keywords only after the word \"color\".  In other positions I'd like them to be ordinary identifiers.</p>\n<p>My current belief is that to achieve that, I'd need to write a custom parser (as found e.g. inside Verso's implementation).  However, if there is some way to avoid this clash more simply, I'd be happy to hear about it.  In particular, the language reference mentions a type <code>Lean.Parser.LeadingIdentBehavior</code> that seems like it might be relevant, though it's not clear how or if it could be applied here.</p>",
        "id": 617204832,
        "sender_full_name": "Adam Dingle",
        "timestamp": 1787059473
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>does making it nonreserved work?</p>",
        "id": 617209025,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1787060484
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Um, how to do that?  In the section \"Defining New Syntax\" in the language reference I see</p>\n<p>\"Ordinarily, valid identifiers occurring as atoms in syntax rules become reserved keywords. Preceding a string literal with an ampersand (<code>&amp;</code>) suppresses this behavior...\"</p>\n<p>OK, let's try that:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s2\">\"red\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s2\">\"blue\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s2\">\"green\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"color\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">red</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">blue</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">green</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Macro</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">throwError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"unknown\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Unfortunately now the line</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">red</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>has this error:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">unexpected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">identifier</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 617211452,
        "sender_full_name": "Adam Dingle",
        "timestamp": 1787061159
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yeah, try <code>declare_syntax_cat (behavior := symbol)</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">behavior</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbol</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"red\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"blue\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"green\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"color\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">red</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">blue</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">green</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Macro</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">throwError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"unknown\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 617211986,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1787061287
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Alternatively, you might not even need a syntax category:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s2\">\"red\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s2\">\"green\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s2\">\"blue\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"color\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">red</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">blue</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">color</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">green</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Macro</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">throwError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"unknown\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 617212145,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1787061325
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Robin: Yes, both of your suggestions work.  Fantastic - thanks so much!</p>",
        "id": 617213350,
        "sender_full_name": "Adam Dingle",
        "timestamp": 1787061608
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>In case it's helpful, <a href=\"https://ericluap.com/lean/2026/01/14/names.html\">here's a blog post I wrote</a> a while ago that explains a bit the errors you saw, nonreserved keywords, and leading ident behavior (at the end)</p>",
